# Issue Driven Workflow

- All changes require a GitHub Issue first.
- Read `docs/roadmap.md`, `docs/milestones/`, and the private `nene-origin/internal-docs/serve/todo/current.md` before starting.
- Never push directly to `main`. Branch: `type/issue-number-summary`.
- Commits: Conventional Commits, English, `(#issue)` in subject (ADR 0008).
- PR: `Closes #number` + checklist from `docs/review/`.
- Canonical: `docs/workflow.md`, `docs/development/commit-conventions.md`.
